# strand-eval reference recordings (docs/eval.md, "Reference recordings"). Written by `strand-eval approve` and `verdict`; a block edited by hand fails its seal.
ref "settings-scroll-gauge-1_75"
verdict good
note "eval-coverage-4 first reference, read frame by frame: at 1.75 the panel slides and fades in on slidefade (y 8 to 0); the arc gauge's value springs from 0.62 to 0.35 with the rolled percentage; charging springs the arc's colour while the tag's fill snaps (~ instant); the scroll body springs to two notches and one back (rows 50 to 25 to 35 px); the refresh button morphs circle to cookie and back; the panel closes on slidefade; the header holds still while the body scrolls"
date 2026-10-19
rev "bbda3d6c+changes"
approver "claude"
scenario d44a7ab7287da769
seal 855833a4ec9590e9
